What's different/added in Enterprise

+---------------------+--------------------------+--------------------------------------------------------------+
| Feature             | Free/Team                | Enterprise                                                   |
+---------------------+--------------------------+--------------------------------------------------------------+
| User provisioning   | Manual invite only       | SCIM — auto-create/deprovision users from Okta/Azure AD/etc. |
| SSO                 | Not available            | SAML SSO — mandatory login via company IdP                   |
| Org structure       | Single org              | Enterprise account sits above multiple orgs — centrally      |
|                     |                          | manage all of them                                           |
| Roles               | Owner/Member only        | Adds Enterprise Owner (controls all orgs under it) above     |
|                     |                          | individual org Owners                                        |
| 2FA enforcement     | Owner can require it     | Same, but can be enforced enterprise-wide across all orgs    |
|                     |                          | at once                                                      |
| Audit log           | Basic, per-org           | Enterprise-wide audit log across all orgs                    |
| IP allowlisting     | ❌                       | ✅ Restrict access by IP range                               |
+---------------------+--------------------------+--------------------------------------------------------------+
